      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like i'm just being too cautious. if i'm careful with it and maybe even take it every other day instead of every day, i feel like i can manage it. plus i've seen people online saying it's basically just a plant and much gentler than actual meds. do you really think it's that dangerous to just try it out for a week and see how i feel?",
